{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/Hero_Image_Small.png?t=1746353683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/Welcome.png?t=1746353683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the first one in these Lost Lands. It is time to build, explore and discover! The wondrous old world holds a lot of mysteries, and you get to be the one to uncover them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/Explore.png?t=1746353683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/Explore.gif?t=1746353683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You start with a lonely bonfire and a lot of unexplored lands around you. Uncover the territory around to discover new places to build, supplies to gather, ruins to explore, runestones to study\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/Builder_and_Interact.png?t=1746353683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/Interact.gif?t=1746353683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each building in Lost Lands has a function and many open up new ways to interact with the world. Build a lumberjacks shack - now you can chop down the forest tiles for wood. Or cut down thorns blocking your way. Or.. many other things. As you expand, so does your toolbelt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/Jarls.png?t=1746353683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/JarlSelection.gif?t=1746353683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Jarl you start the game with has a personal approach to building the settlement - with unique construction trees, talents and goals. Use their strength to adapt to the situations you find yourself in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/Living_World.png?t=1746353683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/Living_World.gif?t=1746353683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every playthrough has a unique landscape, environment and climate! As days and nights go by, so will the seasons, each bringing about changes to your town and the surroundings. Each season also comes with its own set of normal, and sometimes bizarre weather conditions. Prepare for the harsh winter, and use the conditions to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/No_Timer.png?t=1746353683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is nothing to worry about. You cannot lose the game. Grab hot cocoa, wrap yourself in the blanket, relax, and enjoy the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2345940?t=1746353683","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2345940?t=1746353683","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746353683","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746353683","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/Hero_Image_Small.png?t=1746353683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/Welcome.png?t=1746353683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the first one in these Lost Lands. It is time to build, explore and discover! The wondrous old world holds a lot of mysteries, and you get to be the one to uncover them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/Explore.png?t=1746353683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/Explore.gif?t=1746353683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You start with a lonely bonfire and a lot of unexplored lands around you. Uncover the territory around to discover new places to build, supplies to gather, ruins to explore, runestones to study\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/Builder_and_Interact.png?t=1746353683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/Interact.gif?t=1746353683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each building in Lost Lands has a function and many open up new ways to interact with the world. Build a lumberjacks shack - now you can chop down the forest tiles for wood. Or cut down thorns blocking your way. Or.. many other things. As you expand, so does your toolbelt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/Jarls.png?t=1746353683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/JarlSelection.gif?t=1746353683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Jarl you start the game with has a personal approach to building the settlement - with unique construction trees, talents and goals. Use their strength to adapt to the situations you find yourself in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/Living_World.png?t=1746353683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/Living_World.gif?t=1746353683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every playthrough has a unique landscape, environment and climate! As days and nights go by, so will the seasons, each bringing about changes to your town and the surroundings. Each season also comes with its own set of normal, and sometimes bizarre weather conditions. Prepare for the harsh winter, and use the conditions to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/No_Timer.png?t=1746353683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is nothing to worry about. You cannot lose the game. Grab hot cocoa, wrap yourself in the blanket, relax, and enjoy the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Hungry Trolls"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/header.jpg?t=1746353683","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257132936,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132936/movie480.mp4?t=1745952521","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132936/movie_max.mp4?t=1745952521"},"name":"Steam Next Fest Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257132936/9cecc1f42c0ba396d2bb3b861213fb665484261a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745952521","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132936/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745952521","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132936/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745952521"}}],"name":"Lost Lands","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-9300H<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-9300H<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForc